  "scoring_tier": "consistency",
  "scoring_justification": "Full recompute (T1) would require exact knowledge of the hidden oracle’s sign convention; instead the checker validates the agent’s outputs against reference values derived from the paper’s reported coefficients (which the oracle also uses) and checks structural trends, guaranteeing the oracle reaches full reward.",
